{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20264ihN5SODEM1794585823.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>[02:00]</p><p>天文台：未來兩三小時香港廣泛地區可能受大雨影響，市民應提高警覺。</p><p></p><p>[00:00]</p><p>天文台指，現時位於珠江口以西及香港以南海域的雨區正逐漸靠近，預料未來數小時本港雨勢有時頗大。市民請留意天氣變化。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T18:46:28.148592+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T19:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T20:20:39.945290+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T18:39:29.240362+00:00","content_hash":"c638a836507efb2f724e68432cf627b01bdee93abe59bce66e556db53c105f62","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T18:46:28.148592+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}